                                        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-weight: 600; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">🚚 Logistics Information</h3>
                                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><strong>Delivery Address:</strong>{{deliveryAddress}}</p>
                                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><strong>Items:</strong>{{items}}</p>
                                        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><strong>Tracking:</strong> Real-time tracking will be available once processing begins</p>
                                    </td>
